    "text": "Trending Story\nUpdated 03:20 AM UTC, Thu July 24, 2025\nKansas Amber Alert Suspect Arrested After Double Murder and Child Abduction\nCOLES COUNTY, Illinois –A Kansas Amber Alert suspect is in custody and police in Illinois released new details on the capture of 32-year-old Christopher K. Barnshaw. Just after noon Tuesday, police in Mattoon, Illinois, were notified that a suspect in a kidnapping incident in Topeka was possibly in their city, according to a media release from police.\nChris Vallejo\n\"This is a tragedy, and I know the residents around this area are concerned about this, about this event.\"",
